
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Power Gym</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            background: #222;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #ff4500;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #333;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 90px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #252525, #111);
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #ff4500;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ff4500;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        section {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #252525;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            width: 250px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #ff4500;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #222;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>POWER GYM</h1>
        <p>Build Your Strength, Build Your Future</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <h2>WELCOME TO POWER GYM</h2>
        <p>Your fitness journey starts here!</p>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact">Join Us</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Our Gym</h2>
        <p>We help you stay active, healthy and strong.</p>
        <p>Train with us and make fitness part of your life!</p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>

        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>💪 Strength Training</h3>
                <p>Build strength with guided exercises.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🏃 Cardio Workout</h3>
                <p>Improve stamina and fitness.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>🧘 Fitness Guidance</h3>
                <p>Learn healthy exercise habits.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Interested in joining our gym?</p>
        <br>
        <a class="btn"
           href="https://wa.me/919876543210">
           Contact on WhatsApp
        </a>
        <p style="margin-top:15px;">
            Replace this sample number with your WhatsApp number.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Power Gym | All Rights Reserved</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

